{
  "title": "弹幕 P2 合成层策略回测数据（2026-10-13）",
  "capturedAt": "2026-10-13T03:12:08.387955+00:00",
  "head": "6cd5b06a77881cecf436a0ab21a08850479a6532",
  "question": "把 will-change:transform 从每条弹幕的动画包装节点移到组容器（或整体去掉）能否减少合成层、改善性能？",
  "conclusion": "负结果。合成层由 WAAPI 的 ActiveTransformAnimation 提升，will-change 不改变层数；三种策略性能无差异。但 will-change 在 WAAPI 不可用的回退路径上仍是必需的（Style 约 3 倍劣化），因此保留。",
  "fixture": {
    "path": "tests/browser/danmaku-bench.tsx",
    "option": "willChange=node|none|group",
    "mechanism": "用 !important 样式表覆盖节点内联 will-change，不改生产代码；:has() 覆盖采样期间新建的节点",
    "sha256": "343a3b3d35bcd2311f1146ef3741333ccfbcff5d92791cf57f1246a6a5c5805d",
    "runner": "tests/danmaku-p0-performance.browser.js",
    "runnerSHA256": "589a7f334d3a04116cfa39edecca5afb921bfdafccc57071e11c59ee9bf45603",
    "assertion": "prepare 阶段核对 getComputedStyle(wrapper).willChange 实际值，覆盖失效会报错而不是静默退化"
  },
